# ==== Added 2026-09-26, first-commit hygiene ====
# The previous check for "*.bak" matched the substring inside "*.bak-20*" and reported a
# false positive, so .bak files were never actually excluded.
*.bak
# .NET Native / MSBuild output: the repo root .gitignore had obj/ but not bin/.
bin/
# Staging copies of the previous driver build, written by build-driver-dll-arm32.ps1.
Src/port/_driver-backups/
# Captured device-log dumps. Diagnostic evidence, reproducible, and far too large for the
# repository: 466 files / ~432 MB of port-trace.txt alone. The conclusions are preserved in
# Doc/Archive/ and Doc/Archive/PLAN-HISTORY.md; the raw logs stay on disk and in the D: backup.
Doc/localstate-bak-*/
Src/tools/device-logs/